I didn't add the `http-client` import or the enrichment fetch. The node's grant comes from the graph definition, and that hasn't been updated yet, so importing `http-client` would give the component authority the graph doesn't declare. The fetch would also send the selection's text to an external host. Once the graph grants `aap:caps/http-client@0.1.0`, I can add the import and the fetch. The node below uses only `inference-llm`.

